{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19149","headline":"河南王少尹宅燕张常侍白舍人兼呈卢郎中李员外二副使 · 刘禹锡","name":"河南王少尹宅燕张常侍白舍人兼呈卢郎中李员外二副使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将星夜落使星来，三省清臣到外台。\n事重各衔天子诏，礼成同把故人盃。\n卷帘松竹雪初霁，满院池塘春欲回。\n第一林亭迎好客，殷勤莫惜玉山颓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19149.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19149","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}